hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"246","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Urwa bin Zubair se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik raat masjid mein Namaz padhi to logon ne Aap ki Namaz ke sath Namaz padhi, phir agli raat Namaz padhi to log bahut ho gae, phir teesri ya chauthi raat mein jama hue to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un ke paas na nikle, phir jab subah hui to farmaya ke maine wo dekha jo tum ne kya aur mujhe tumhari taraf nikalne se sirf is ne roka ke mujhe khauf tha ke tum par farz kar di jaye. Aur ye Ramzan mein tha."
"247","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramzan ke qiyam ki targheeb dete baghair is ke ke pakke hukm se hukm dein aur farmate ke jo Ramzan mein iman aur sawab ki niyat se qiyam kare us ke agle gunah bakhsh diye jain ge. Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafaat hui aur muamla isi par tha, phir muamla isi par tha Abu Bakr ki khilafat mein aur Umar bin Khattab ki khilafat ke ibtidai hisse mein."
"248","Mujhe Malik ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Urwa bin Zubair se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Abdul Qari se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Ramzan mein Umar bin Khattab ke sath masjid ki taraf nikla to log bikhre hue muntashir they, shakhs apne liye Namaz padhta aur shakhs Namaz padhta to jamaat us ki Namaz ke sath Namaz padhti, to Umar ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam main samajhta hun ke agar main inhein aik qari par jama kar dun to behtar hoga. Phir unhein Ubay bin Kaab par jama kya. Unhon ne kaha ke phir main un ke sath dusri raat nikla aur log apne qari ki Namaz ke sath Namaz padh rahe they to Umar ne kaha ke ye achchhi bidat hai, aur jis se tum sote ho wo us se afzal hai jis mein tum qiyam karte ho. Yani raat ka aakhir, aur log awal mein qiyam karte they."
"249","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Yusuf se, unhon ne Saib bin Yazeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Umar bin Khattab ne Ubay bin Kaab aur Tamim Dari ko hukm diya ke logon ko gyarah rakat padhain. Unhon ne kaha ke qari saaon aayaton wali surtein padhta tha yahan tak ke hum lambe qiyam se laathiyon par tek lagate they aur hum Fajr ke qareeb hone ke siwa na laute."
"250","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yazeed bin Ruman se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke log Umar bin Khattab ke zamane mein Ramzan mein teis rakat qiyam karte they."
"251","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dawood bin Husain se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Aaraj ko kehte suna ke maine logon ko na paya magar is haal mein ke wo Ramzan mein kafiron par lanat karte they. Unhon ne kaha ke qari Surah Baqara aath rakaton mein padhta tha, phir jab use barah rakaton mein padhta to log samajhte ke us ne halka kya."
"252","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine apne walid ko kehte suna ke hum Ramzan mein laute to khadimon ko khane mein jaldi karate Fajr ke khauf se."
"253","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Zakwan Abu Amr, jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ke ghulam they phir unhon ne unhein apni taraf se dubur ki shart par azaad kya tha, Ramzan mein un ke liye qiyam karke qiraat karte they."
